#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:638
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ):"
msgstr "Preguntas frecuentes (FAQ):"

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:672
msgid "How to add a new coin to the widget?"
msgstr "¿Cómo añadir una nueva moneda al widget?"

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:697
msgid ""
"Go to the \"Coin List\" tab in settings and use the search bar by name or "
"ticker (btc, eth, sol), or use batch adding separated by dots (btc.eth.sol)."
msgstr ""

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:730
msgid "What does \"Rate limit exceeded\" mean?"
msgstr "¿Qué significa «Rate limit exceeded»?"

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:755
msgid ""
"The free public CoinGecko API has a request limit per minute. If this limit "
"is exceeded, the widget automatically enables a 60-second protective "
"countdown timer and will resume updating data after it finishes."
msgstr ""

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:788
msgid "How do system notifications (Alerts) work?"
msgstr "¿Cómo funcionan las notificaciones del sistema (Alertas)?"

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:813
msgid ""
"In the \"Alerts\" tab, you can set up triggers for coins reaching specific "
"prices, 24h high/low breakouts, ATH/ATL reach, as well as macro indicators "
"(Fear & Greed index shifts, BTC/ETH dominance, etc.)."
msgstr ""

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:846
msgid "Why does the panel indicator status change?"
msgstr "¿Por qué cambia el estado del indicador del panel?"

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:871
msgid ""
"The indicator on the Plasma panel reflects the real-time overall state of "
"the crypto market (e.g. panic/correction, rally/growth, flat/accumulation, "
"altseason)."
msgstr ""
"El indicador en el panel de Plasma refleja el estado general del mercado "
"cripto en tiempo real (p. ej., pánico/corrección, rally/crecimiento, lateral/"
"acumulación, altseason)."

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:904
msgid "How to select an individual card for the desktop?"
msgstr "¿Cómo seleccionar una tarjeta individual para el escritorio?"

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:929
msgid ""
"When placing the widget directly on the desktop (desktop mode), open "
"\"General Settings\" and choose one of the 15 card types (Coin Card, Fear & "
"Greed Index, Global Market Cap, BTC Halving, ETH/BTC, Rainbow Zone, etc.)."
msgstr ""

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:962
msgid "Where does the widget fetch price data from?"
msgstr "¿De dónde obtiene el widget los datos de precios?"

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:987
msgid ""
"The widget receives current price quotes from the CoinGecko API, and the "
"Fear & Greed Index from the Alternative.me API."
msgstr ""

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:1020
msgid "Does the widget work without an internet connection?"
msgstr "¿Funciona el widget sin conexión a internet?"

#: /home/alex/Crypto-hub/contents/ui/settings/SupportSettings.qml:1045
msgid ""
"Searching and adding coins work offline thanks to a local SQLite database. "
"An active internet connection is required to update real-time prices."
msgstr ""

